#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/snippets.rst:2
msgid "Snippets"
msgstr "Isečci"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/snippets.rst:6
msgid ""
"The calibre E-book editor supports *snippets*. A snippet is a piece of text "
"that is either re-used often or contains a lot of redundant text. The editor"
" allows you to insert a snippet with only a few key strokes. For example, "
"suppose you often find yourself inserting link tags when editing HTML files,"
" then you can simply type ``<a`` in the editor and press |ct|. The editor "
"will expand it to::"
msgstr "Uređivač e-knjiga u programu calibre podržava *isečke*. Isečak je deo teksta koji se često koristi ili sadrži mnogo teksta koji se ponavlja. Uređivač vam omogućava da ga umetnete sa svega nekoliko pritisaka na tastere. Na primer, ako pri uređivanju HTML fajlova često umećete oznake za linkove, dovoljno je da ukucate ``<a`` i pritisnete |ct|. Uređivač će to proširiti u::"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/snippets.rst:15
msgid ""
"Not only that, the word ``filename`` will be selected, with the cursor "
"placed over it, so that you can easily type in the real filename, using the "
"editor's nifty :ref:`editor_auto_complete` feature. And once you are done "
"typing the filename, press |ct| again and the cursor will jump to the "
"position in between the ``<a>`` tags so you can easily type in the text for "
"the link."
msgstr "Ne samo to, reč ``filename`` će biti izabrana, sa kursorom postavljenim preko nje, tako da možete lako ukucati pravo ime datoteke, koristeći sjajnu funkciju uređivača :ref:`editor_auto_complete`. A kada završite sa kucanjem imena datoteke, ponovo pritisnite |ct| i kursor će skočiti na poziciju između ``<a>`` oznaka tako da možete lako ukucati tekst za vezu."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/snippets.rst:21
msgid ""
"The snippets system in the editor is very sophisticated, there are a few "
"built-in snippets and you can create your own to suit your editing style."
msgstr "Sistem isečaka u uređivaču je veoma sofisticiran, postoji nekoliko ugrađenih isečaka i možete kreirati sopstvene kako bi odgovarali vašem stilu uređivanja."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/snippets.rst:24
msgid ""
"The following discussion of the built-in snippets should help illustrate the"
" power of the snippets system."
msgstr "Opis ugrađenih isečaka koji sledi pokazaće vam šta sve ovaj sistem može da uradi."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/snippets.rst:28
msgid ""
"You can also use snippets in the text entry fields in the :guilabel:`Search "
"& replace` panel, however, placeholders (using |ct| to jump around) will not"
" work."
msgstr "Isečke možete koristiti i u poljima za unos teksta na panelu :guilabel:`Search & replace`, ali rezervisana mesta i prelazak između njih pomoću |ct| tamo ne rade."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/snippets.rst:33
msgid "The built-in snippets"
msgstr "Ugrađeni isečci"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/snippets.rst:35
msgid ""
"The built-in snippets are described below. Note that you can override them "
"by creating your own snippets with the same trigger text."
msgstr "Ugrađeni isečci su opisani u nastavku. Imajte na umu da ih možete zameniti kreiranjem sopstvenih isečaka sa istim tekstom okidača."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/snippets.rst:39
msgid "Inserting filler text [Lorem]"
msgstr "Ubacivanje teksta za popunjavanje [Lorem]"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/snippets.rst:41
msgid ""
"The first built-in snippet, and the simplest is used to insert filler text "
"into a document. The filler text is taken from `De finibus bonorum et "
"malorum <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/De_finibus_bonorum_et_malorum>`_ a "
"philosophical work by Cicero (translated to English). To use it simply type "
"``Lorem`` in an HTML file and press |ct|. It will be replaced by a couple of"
" paragraphs of filler."
msgstr "Prvi ugrađeni isečak, i najjednostavniji, koristi se za ubacivanje teksta za popunjavanje u dokument. Tekst za popunjavanje je preuzet iz `De finibus bonorum et malorum <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/De_finibus_bonorum_et_malorum>`_ filozofskog dela Cicerona (prevedenog na engleski). Da biste ga koristili, jednostavno ukucajte ``Lorem`` u HTML datoteku i pritisnite |ct|. Biće zamenjen sa nekoliko pasusa teksta za popunjavanje."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/snippets.rst:48
msgid ""
"The definition of this snippet is very simple, the trigger text is defined "
"as ``Lorem`` and the template is defined simply as the literal text to be "
"inserted. You can easily customize it to use your favorite form of filler "
"text."
msgstr "Definicija ovog isečka je veoma jednostavna, tekst okidača je definisan kao ``Lorem``, a šablon je definisan jednostavno kao doslovni tekst koji treba ubaciti. Možete ga lako prilagoditi da koristi vaš omiljeni oblik teksta za popunjavanje."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/snippets.rst:53
msgid "Inserting a self-closing HTML tag [<>]"
msgstr "Ubacivanje samozatvarajuće HTML oznake [<>]"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/snippets.rst:55
msgid ""
"Now let's look at a simple example of the powerful concept of "
"*placeholders*. Say you want to insert the self-closing tag ``<hr/>``. Just "
"type ``<>``, and press |ct|, the editor will expand the snippet to::"
msgstr "Sada pogledajmo jednostavan primer moćnog koncepta *rezervisanih mesta*. Recimo da želite da ubacite samozatvarajuću oznaku ``<hr/>``. Samo ukucajte ``<>`` i pritisnite |ct|, uređivač će proširiti isečak na::"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/snippets.rst:61
msgid ""
"Here, the ``|`` symbol represents the current cursor position. You can then "
"type ``hr`` and press |ct| to move the cursor to after the end of the tag. "
"This snippet is defined as::"
msgstr "Ovde simbol ``|`` predstavlja trenutnu poziciju kursora. Zatim možete ukucati ``hr`` i pritisnuti |ct| da pomerite kursor posle kraja oznake. Ovaj isečak je definisan kao::"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/snippets.rst:68
msgid ""
"Placeholders are simply the dollar ($) sign followed by a number. When the "
"snippet is expanded by pressing |ct| the cursor is positioned at the first "
"placeholder (the placeholder with the lowest number). When you press |ct| "
"again the cursor jumps to the next placeholder (the placeholder with the "
"next higher number)."
msgstr "Rezervisana mesta su jednostavno znak dolara ($) praćen brojem. Kada se isečak proširi pritiskom na |ct|, kursor se pozicionira na prvo rezervisano mesto (rezervisano mesto sa najmanjim brojem). Kada ponovo pritisnete |ct|, kursor skače na sledeće rezervisano mesto (rezervisano mesto sa sledećim većim brojem)."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/snippets.rst:75
msgid "Inserting an HTML link tag [<a]"
msgstr "Ubacivanje HTML oznake za vezu [<a]"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/snippets.rst:77
msgid ""
"HTML link tags all share a common structure. They have an ``href`` attribute"
" and some text between the opening and closing tags. A snippet to make "
"typing them more efficient will introduce us to some more features of "
"placeholders. To use this snippet, simply type ``<a`` and press |ct|. The "
"editor will expand this to::"
msgstr "Sve HTML oznake za veze dele zajedničku strukturu. Imaju atribut ``href`` i neki tekst između početne i završne oznake. Isečak koji će učiniti njihovo kucanje efikasnijim upoznaće nas sa još nekim funkcijama rezervisanih mesta. Da biste koristili ovaj isečak, jednostavno ukucajte ``<a`` i pritisnite |ct|. Uređivač će ovo proširiti na::"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/snippets.rst:85
msgid ""
"Not only that, the word ``filename`` will be selected, with the cursor "
"placed over it, so that you can easily type in the real filename, using the "
"editor's nifty :ref:`editor_auto_complete` feature. And once you are done "
"typing the filename, press |ct| again and the cursor will jump to the "
"position in between the ``<a>`` tags so you can easily type in the text for "
"the link. After you are done typing the text, press |ct| again to jump to "
"the point after the closing tag.  This snippet is defined as::"
msgstr "Pored toga, reč ``filename`` biće označena, a kursor postavljen na nju, tako da pomoću korisne funkcije :ref:`editor_auto_complete` možete lako uneti pravo ime fajla. Kada ga unesete, ponovo pritisnite |ct|: kursor će preći između oznaka ``<a>``, gde možete uneti tekst linka. Kada završite, još jednom pritisnite |ct| da pređete iza završne oznake. Ovaj isečak je definisan ovako::"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/snippets.rst:96
msgid ""
"There are a couple of new features here. First the ``$1`` placeholder has "
"become more complex. It now includes some *default text* (the word "
"``filename``). If a placeholder contains default text, the default text is "
"substituted for the placeholder when the snippet is expanded. Also when you "
"jump to a placeholder with default text using |ct|, the default text is "
"selected. In this way, you can use default text to act as a reminder to you "
"to fill in important parts of the template. You can specify default text for"
" a placeholder by using the syntax: ``${<number>:default text}``."
msgstr "Ovde se pojavljuje nekoliko novih mogućnosti. Prvo, rezervisano mesto ``$1`` sada je složenije: sadrži *podrazumevani tekst* (reč ``filename``). Pri proširivanju isečka taj tekst se umeće na mesto rezervisanog mesta. Kada pomoću |ct| pređete na njega, podrazumevani tekst biće označen, pa vas može podsetiti da popunite važan deo šablona. Podrazumevani tekst zadaje se sintaksom ``${<number>:default text}``."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/snippets.rst:105
msgid ""
"The other new feature is that the second placeholder has an asterisk after "
"it (``${2*}``). This means that any text that was selected before expanding "
"the template is substituted for the placeholder. To see this in action, "
"select some text in the editor, press |ct|, type ``<a`` and press |ct| "
"again, the template will be expanded to::"
msgstr "Druga novina je zvezdica iza drugog rezervisanog mesta (``${2*}``). Ona znači da će se na to mesto umetnuti tekst označen pre proširivanja šablona. Isprobajte: označite tekst u uređivaču, pritisnite |ct|, ukucajte ``<a`` i ponovo pritisnite |ct|. Šablon će se proširiti u::"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/snippets.rst:114
msgid "Inserting an HTML image tag [<i]"
msgstr "Umetanje HTML oznake za sliku [<i]"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/snippets.rst:116
msgid ""
"This is very similar to inserting an HTML link, as we saw above. It allows "
"you to quickly input an ``<img src=\"filename\" alt=\"description\" />`` tag"
" and jump between the ``src`` and ``alt`` attributes::"
msgstr "Ovo je slično umetanju HTML linka iz prethodnog primera. Možete brzo uneti oznaku ``<img src=\"filename\" alt=\"description\" />`` i prelaziti između atributa ``src`` i ``alt``::"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/snippets.rst:124
msgid "Insert an arbitrary HTML tag [<<]"
msgstr "Umetanje proizvoljne HTML oznake [<<]"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/snippets.rst:126
msgid ""
"This allows you to insert an arbitrary full HTML tag (or wrap previously "
"selected text in the tag). To use it, simply type ``<<`` and press |ct|. If "
"you want to wrap selected text, first select the text, press |ct| then type "
"``<<`` and press |ct| again. The editor will expand it to::"
msgstr "Ovako možete umetnuti proizvoljnu HTML oznaku s početkom i krajem ili njome obuhvatiti prethodno označen tekst. Ukucajte ``<<`` i pritisnite |ct|. Ako želite da obuhvatite postojeći tekst, najpre ga označite, pritisnite |ct|, ukucajte ``<<`` i ponovo pritisnite |ct|. Uređivač će isečak proširiti u::"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/snippets.rst:134
msgid ""
"Type the tag name, for example: ``span`` and press |ct|, that will result "
"in::"
msgstr "Ukucajte ime oznake, na primer ``span``, pa pritisnite |ct|. Dobićete::"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/snippets.rst:138
msgid ""
"You will note that the closing tag has been automatically filled with "
"``span``. This is achieved with yet another feature of placeholders, "
"*mirroring*. Mirroring simply means that if you specify the same placeholder"
" more than once in a template, the second and all later positions will be "
"automatically filled in with whatever you type in the first position, when "
"you press |ct|. The definition for this snippet is::"
msgstr "Primetite da je završna oznaka automatski popunjena sa ``span``. Ovo se postiže još jednom funkcijom rezervisanih mesta, *preslikavanjem*. Preslikavanje jednostavno znači da ako navedete isto rezervisano mesto više od jednom u šablonu, druga i sve kasnije pozicije će biti automatski popunjene onim što ukucate na prvoj poziciji, kada pritisnete |ct|. Definicija za ovaj isečak je::"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/snippets.rst:148
msgid ""
"As you can see, the first placeholder ($1) has been specified twice, the "
"second time in the closing tag, which will simply copy whatever you type in "
"the opening tag."
msgstr "Kao što vidite, prvo rezervisano mesto ($1) je navedeno dva puta, drugi put u završnoj oznaci, koja će jednostavno kopirati ono što ukucate u početnoj oznaci."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/snippets.rst:153
msgid "Inserting an arbitrary HTML tag with a class attribute [<c]"
msgstr "Umetanje proizvoljne HTML oznake sa atributom klase [<c]"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/snippets.rst:155
msgid ""
"This is very similar to the insert arbitrary tag example above, except that "
"it assumes that you want to specify a class for the tag::"
msgstr "Ovo je veoma slično primeru umetanja proizvoljne oznake iznad, osim što pretpostavlja da želite da navedete klasu za oznaku::"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/snippets.rst:161
msgid ""
"This will allow you to first type the tag name, press |ct|, type the class "
"name, press |ct| type the contents of the tag and press |ct| one last time "
"to jump out of the tag. The closing tag will be auto-filled."
msgstr "Ovo će vam omogućiti da prvo ukucate ime oznake, pritisnete |ct|, ukucate ime klase, pritisnete |ct| ukucate sadržaj oznake i pritisnete |ct| poslednji put da biste iskočili iz oznake. Završna oznaka će biti automatski popunjena."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/snippets.rst:167
msgid "Creating your own snippets"
msgstr "Pravljenje sopstvenih isečaka"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/snippets.rst:169
msgid ""
"Snippets really shine because you can create your own to suit your editing "
"style. To create your own snippets go to "
":guilabel:`Edit->Preferences->Editor settings->Manage snippets` in the "
"editor. This will pop-up an easy to use dialog to help you create your own "
"snippets. Simply click the :guilabel:`Add snippet` button and you will see a"
" dialog that looks like:"
msgstr "Isečke možete prilagoditi svom načinu uređivanja. Da biste napravili sopstveni isečak, u uređivaču otvorite :guilabel:`Edit->Preferences->Editor settings->Manage snippets`. Pojaviće se dijalog za pravljenje isečaka. Kliknite na :guilabel:`Add snippet` i videćete sledeći dijalog:"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/snippets.rst:175
msgid "The create your own snippets tool"
msgstr "Alat za pravljenje sopstvenih isečaka"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/snippets.rst:180
msgid ""
"First give your snippet a name, something descriptive, to help identify the "
"snippet in the future. Then specify the *trigger*. A trigger is simply the "
"text that you have to type in the editor before pressing |ct| in order to "
"expand the snippet."
msgstr "Prvo dajte svom isečku ime, nešto opisno, kako biste lakše prepoznali isečak u budućnosti. Zatim odredite *okidač*. Okidač je jednostavno tekst koji morate ukucati u uređivaču pre nego što pritisnete |ct| da biste proširili isečak."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/snippets.rst:185
msgid ""
"Then specify the snippet template. You should start with one of the examples"
" above and modify it to suit your needs. Finally, specify which file types "
"you want the snippet to be active for. This way you can have multiple "
"snippets with the same trigger text that work differently in different file "
"types."
msgstr "Zatim odredite šablon isečka. Trebalo bi da počnete sa jednim od primera iznad i prilagodite ga svojim potrebama. Na kraju, odredite za koje tipove datoteka želite da isečak bude aktivan. Na ovaj način možete imati više isečaka sa istim tekstom okidača koji rade različito u različitim tipovima datoteka."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/snippets.rst:190
msgid ""
"The next step is to test your newly created snippet. Use the "
":guilabel:`Test` box at the bottom. Type in the trigger text and press |ct| "
"to expand the snippet and jump between placeholders."
msgstr "Zatim isprobajte novi isečak u polju :guilabel:`Test` na dnu dijaloga. Ukucajte tekst okidača i pritisnite |ct| da proširite isečak i pređete s jednog rezervisanog mesta na drugo."
